{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fried Dungeons is a virtual map builder and online role-playing platform designed to bring your RPG sessions to life\u2014no matter where your group is.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Intuitive map editor</strong>: draw terrain, add tokens, traps, enemies, and everything you need to build your campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GM and Player modes</strong>: everyone sees only what they\u2019re supposed to. Reveal areas with fog of war, hide enemies, and use private notes for surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in dice rolling</strong>: supports dice syntax and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong>: play with your group in real time, from anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full GM control</strong>: from the narrative to the terrain details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re running an epic fantasy campaign, a cosmic horror mystery, or a spontaneous one-shot\u2014this app gives you the tools and freedom to bring your story to life.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352000?t=1755503107","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3352000?t=1755503107","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352000/7480818be1b6fa8a371c6111dbfcb3da1b14f672/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755503107","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352000/7480818be1b6fa8a371c6111dbfcb3da1b14f672/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755503107","categories":[{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fried Dungeons is a virtual map builder and online role-playing platform designed to bring your RPG sessions to life\u2014no matter where your group is.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Intuitive map editor</strong>: draw terrain, add tokens, traps, enemies, and everything you need to build your campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GM and Player modes</strong>: everyone sees only what they\u2019re supposed to. Reveal areas with fog of war, hide enemies, and use private notes for surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in dice rolling</strong>: supports dice syntax and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online multiplayer</strong>: play with your group in real time, from anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full GM control</strong>: from the narrative to the terrain details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re running an epic fantasy campaign, a cosmic horror mystery, or a spontaneous one-shot\u2014this app gives you the tools and freedom to bring your story to life.</p>","developers":["Vitrusoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352000/a6d0aa2250624a95dd71cb04a034cd59501bbb57/header.jpg?t=1755503107","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3352000/813133937/8daa3bab1d65443b83900df5f3e7460e41834d67/1751489966/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754337541","dash_h264":"https://vi